{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-amaranta-villanova","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"amaranta-villanova-dubai-investments-dubailand-residence-complex","about":"Amaranta Villanova is a multi-phase residential project offering a collection of elegant townhouses and villas with 2 - 4 bedrooms and courtyard. The development is part of the gated Villanova community developed by Dubai Properties.The interior design of each residence is Mediterranean-inspired and includes spacious bedrooms, a staff room, laundry room, storage and a two-car garage. All houses are designed to maximize convenience and functionality, using quality materials and are perfect for family living.Residents have access to all the amenities available in the community, including landscaped parks with dedicated jogging and biking paths, recreational areas, entertainment venues: movie theater, shopping center, barbecue area and world-class sports facilities: gym, fitness center, large swimming pools, basketball court.The complex is located between the major city highways Emirates Road and Academic City Road. This provides fairly quick access to major infrastructure facilities in the large urban community of Dubailand. The business district Dubai Silicon Oasis is 14 minutes away, Arabian Ranches 2 is 18 minutes away, 30 minutes to the nearest beach Kite Beach, 39 minutes to Dubai International Airport.","price":3100000,"title":"Amaranta Villanova","bitrix":{"id":623,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Amaranta Villanova","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Amaranta Villanova","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Dubai Investments","project_location":"Dubailand"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1101/images/2024/02/22/340x252/EsRzfGbosoKkaZ30QqeCssTogqLUUcJRLqCxY2q9.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1101/images/2024/02/22/464x312/EsR